error[KL1008]: `My_App` is not a valid `Deployment` name: a lowercase RFC 1123 subdomain must consist of lower case alphanumeric characters, '-' or '.', and must start and end with an alphanumeric character (e.g. 'example.com')
 --> correctness/KL1008.yaml:5:9
  |
5 |   name: My_App
  |         ^^^^^^
  = help: use lowercase letters, digits and `-`, for example `my-app`

